格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent-first Kanban system base on Cloudflare.","id":"gh:1350478233","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"cfKanban","slug":"breakstring/cfKanban","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agents","cloudflare","cloudflare-d1","cloudflare-workers","codex-plugin","dsh-plugin","kanban","project-management","self-hosted","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent-first Kanban system base on Cloudflare."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# cfKanban"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"cfKanban is a small, self-hosted Kanban for people who work through Agents. You ask your Agent to de"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ploy and operate it; the same Cloudflare Worker also serves a bilingual Web board for direct human u"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"y and operate it; the same Cloudflare Worker also serves a bilingual Web board for direct human use."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It runs as one Cloudflare Worker plus one D1 database, with optional private R2 storage for Issue at"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"tachments. There is no separate server, Pages project, or KV namespace. The public CLI shares the Sk"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ills runtime and Service rules."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## See it in action"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82e0eac9-43b1-4fd5-ae25-d3e11338c734"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Stable releases"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"First installations and new deployments use the latest stable release by default. You do not need to"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" choose or enter a version: your Agent discovers it through the official stable release entry, verif"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ies and pins the exact artifacts, then prepares the installation or deployment plan. Existing truste"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"d, compatible Skills can be reused; joining a Project does not upgrade its server."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Local Skill updates and cloud Instance upgrades are separate actions. Prereleases, historical versio"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ns, and source development require an explicit choice. If stable is unavailable or verification fail"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"s, the Agent reports the problem instead of substituting a development snapshot."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Release archives do not contain a Node.js executable. The Skill bundle includes four Skills and shar"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ed JavaScript helpers that run with your compatible Node.js; releases supporting the public CLI also"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" include its prebuilt entry. The Service bundle includes the built Worker, Web assets, migrations, c"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ontracts, and a Wrangler configuration skeleton. The Agent generates private configuration from the "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"approved plan; users do not need to unpack or edit the artifacts manually."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The CLI task guide covers terminal use, installation, daily work, administration and deployment. The"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" CLI is being prepared in this source branch; check the installed verified release before assuming i"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ts commands are available. Local CLI updates and Instance upgrades are separate."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What you need"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"For any supported Agent host:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- support for loading Skills, reading HTTPS documents, and running local Node.js scripts;\n- a compat"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ible Node.js environment and persistent private storage for your identity;\n- access to the official "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"release downloads, plus Git access if using a Git-based installation."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The Agent uses the host’s supported Skill directories or plugin mechanism. Some hosts need a new con"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"versation after installation to load the Skills."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For your own Cloudflare deployment you will also need:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- a Cloudflare account that can create one Worker and one D1 database;\n- a compatible Node.js and Wr"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"angler environment. `cfkanban-deploy` checks what already exists first. If Wrangler is unavailable, "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"it must show a separate installation plan before adding a pinned Wrangler package under `~/.cfkanban"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"/tool-runtime/`; it does not bundle or install Node.js;\n- the Owner display name you want cfKanban t"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"o use. The Agent must not guess it from your operating-system or Git identity."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install the Skills"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Give your Agent this request:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> Read https://github.com/breakstring/cfKanban/releases/latest/download/install.md and install the l"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"atest stable cfKanban Skills for me."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The Agent identifies your host, checks existing installations, and explains the required local chang"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"es. Hosts with a compatible Git plugin or marketplace source can follow the repository’s default `ma"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"in` branch, which contains only published stable releases; Codex is one example and does not need `-"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"-ref` for ordinary installation. Hosts that load local Skill directories use the complete verified b"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"undle, including its shared runtime. The Agent checks the selected release and actual installed file"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"s for either method. Installation does not deploy or upgrade a Cloudflare instance or grant applicat"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"hod. Installation does not deploy or upgrade a Cloudflare instance or grant application permissions."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"If your Git-based installation is pinned to an old tag, ask the Agent to switch its registered sourc"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"e to the default branch and update the host installation. Editing a copied command alone does not ch"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ange the saved setting. Local-directory installations continue using the bundle update path. Keep yo"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ur private `.cfkanban/` identity and deployment records. Neither installation method updates automat"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"ically just because a new release appears; ask for an update, then reload the host or start a new co"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"nversation when required."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"cfKanban contains four Skills: an onboarding guide and three operational Skills:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Skill | Ask it to help with |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## What the deployment Skill handles for you"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The Skill is responsible for:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"1. confirming the exact release and checking that its files have not changed;\n2. checking the comput"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"er and reusing compatible Node.js and Wrangler installations when possible;\n3. reusing an exact jour"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"nal/receipt auth target or asking Wrangler to resolve the current private deployment/config context;"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" an alternate profile is considered only when the user explicitly names it, while the private config"},{"id":"p29s5","text":" pins the exact account;\n4. showing the resources, local changes, costs, and recovery limits before "},{"id":"p29s6","text":"asking for approval;\n5. creating one Worker, one D1 database, and the bundled Web app only after app"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"roval;\n6. reading everything back before reporting that deployment succeeded."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The default plan creates only one Worker and one D1 database on `workers.dev`. Custom domains, paid "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"services, destructive migrations, resource adoption or replacement, and permission changes require a"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ve migrations, resource adoption or replacement, and permission changes require a new explicit plan."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Local data and security boundaries"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"cfKanban-owned persistent local data uses the current execution environment user's private directory"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"fKanban-owned persistent local data uses the current execution environment user's private directory:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Host discovery entries, marketplace configuration, and plugin caches remain in the directories manag"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ed by the corresponding Agent host. They are disposable host projections, not cfKanban state or cano"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"nical release truth. Windows native and WSL2 use separate user homes and are never mixed automatical"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"al release truth. Windows native and WSL2 use separate user homes and are never mixed automatically."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

